          9363
        ],
        "text_sha256": "a212ceb5a8fd376c1dc844c243b601f4c8c012ac01399560d67787c9a6a7e533"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "name": "缺失情节",
      "text": "**4｜缺失情节**  \n83-S1社交缘由；83-S2麒麟不立刻神化；83-S3消息经人转述。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          241,
