          9363,
          9463
        ],
        "text_sha256": "072f90fe1fd94d3362e61f85da67d218802623cc3f38fa41bb906cb2fc506cac"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "name": "人物",
      "text": "**5｜人物**  \n看圃老仆是好用的小人物；不得再添“神秘老人识麒麟”。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
